WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.980
Block off a 5km perimeter around Shinigusa Park.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.240
Displaying current image of the target.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.890
Display image.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.810
Image displayed.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.240
Zoom into target.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.680
Zooming in.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.950
Intersections have been sealed.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.530
Intersections sealed.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.530
This is Operations Team.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.930
Arrived at the strategic coordinates.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:23.850
Roger.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:27.210
B-Seeker, head to Route 11 from Rena Junction.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.050
Condition all green for Alpha through Epsilon.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.040
Metropolitan Expressway 2, Iogi entrance, sealed.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.460
Operation time is 21 minutes and 40 seconds from kickoff.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:42.060
Target BF503 is traveling north through Shinigusa park.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.440
Cannot lock onto target.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.890
All neighboring roads have been sealed.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.650
All personnel are at their stations.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.430
Signal strength, please.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.870
Signal strength: 5.991.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:10.990
It's broken phase six.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.710
How's the bestia?

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.960
Target BF503's larva signal is still unstable.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:19.800
The signal level is above average level.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.720
Begin.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.920
Yes, sir.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.470
Stay back!

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.050
Breaking phase eight.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.470
Larva signal has broken phase eight.

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.910
Target's transformation has begun.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:04.270
Huh?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:42.530
Shit!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.220
Carrier two lost.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:36.030
Beginning sweep around area.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.870
WTOC has reached its operational time limit.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.510
There are also abnormal readings in Epsilon's brain waves.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.520
Retreat.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.250
Notice to WTOC.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.400
Operation is canceled.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.520
Begin retreat.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:52.710
Roger.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:59.190
So that... was Insania.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.100
Chapter One  「Ephemeral Petals」

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:09.900
Quon-sama.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.360
How is your body?

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.650
It's fine now.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:19.610
Thank you, Tei.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.360
How is he?

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.400
Do you mean Yuuma-kun?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.040
He's stable now.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.140
It was fortunate that he hadn't exceeded the danger level.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.120
I see.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.130
That's good.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.830
You may be tough, Quon-sama,

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.470
but after your injury last night...

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.630
Honestly, I'm fine.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.670
Everyone's already hard at work.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:47.110
I can't just slack off.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.730
Let's go. It's business hours.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.470
Welcome to Fantasium Garden!

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.680
Come in for an enticing dream experience!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.780
We have lots of events for you to enjoy.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.390
Hey, did you know?

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.720
Fantasium Garden is also called Shinjuku Cabbage.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.960
I'm Cabbagey!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.550
Morning, Takao.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:12.370
I'm helping out at the Goat Corner.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:15.270
I'll be your guide, so come say hello!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.100
When are you gonna stop doing the impossible?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:22.250
You can't save everyone who awakens.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.970
It's just impossible.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.340
Our only fighters are you and Yuri!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:33.030
Still...

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.820
I want to save everyone.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.720
Once you're done feeding them,
can you feed the birds?

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.640
Okay.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:51.390
Goat is a common name for an animal
of the genus Bovidae Capra.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:55.050
It usually refers to the domestic variety.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:59.300
There are seven different varieties.
The most common is the Bezoar goat.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.310
Also— huh?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.110
Hey! Look at this, Quon.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.350
I got a rash again because I used my power!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:17.320
My beautiful skin has a rash!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.830
But we couldn't have saved Yuuma-kun without it.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.740
Hey, can you check over here?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.920
There's nothing wrong.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.420
You're perfectly fine.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.130
See ya!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.130
Hey wait, Quon!

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.270
You perverted old man!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.240
How nostalgic.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.260
This place used to overflow with dyed cloth.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:11.540
The clothes floating in the river looked as if they were dancing.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.260
It was beautiful.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:18.260
It was a long time ago though.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:28.940
Is that a music box?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.430
Could I listen to it?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.800
Thank you.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.300
It's definitely a great piece.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.930
Hey!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:08.840
You've got some nerve picking up girls instead of working!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:13.230
Honestly!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.470
I'm sorry.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.480
We're supposed to be working.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.480
We'll treat you well, so come play, okay?

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.990
And you! Back to work!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.660
Stop, Yuri!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:34.540
When I sensed her power, that piece was playing.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.200
Are you sure?

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.610
Yeah.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.560
She's also awakening.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:58.420
Targets BF503 and AA001, aka Insania, have been lost.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.110
They're off the radar.

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:03.360
New signal found in west Tokyo.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.530
Beginning surveillance.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:10.040
Ordo has made significant investments in developing and maintaining you.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:15.360
If you don't accomplish your tasks,
then you're just a bunch of useless tin dolls.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:18.830
Yes, the three destroyed units can't move,

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.800
but why did you fail to act, Epsilon?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:26.090
You weren't nervous on your first operation, I hope?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.700
When I...

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:32.470
identified Insania, I did hesitate for a second.

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:33.100
However...

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:37.350
Will you do better next time?

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.100
Am I dealing with a rookie soldier?

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:41.080
Watch what you say.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.000
Sir.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.240
I demand perfection and completeness in every respect.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.120
Please remember that, Rookie-kun.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.270
Sir.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.210
I don't see anything wrong.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.620
What a strange feeling.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:05.890
When I had a real body, I couldn't stand to just sit around all day long.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.900
With our current technology,

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:12.570
we still can't surpass the reaction time between the brain and the nervous system.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:15.900
However, we can manage everything else in software,

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:20.210
so we can even control emotions like boredom.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:24.520
All of my physical parts are working fine.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.410
Why don't you try rebooting?

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:32.410
I don't want a malfunctioning unit
that acts on emotion watching my back.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:37.670
It's only because your brain is working
at all that you can be sarcastic.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.090
You're a nice person.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:48.430
Not entirely.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:52.220
I'm treating you guys as objects
when you still have emotions.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.890
If there's a heart in my body,

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.730
then it's made entirely of tektite.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.720
Keep your heart strong.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.740
You have a wonderful ability.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:10.240
However, you'll only make everyone sad if you abuse it.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.620
Don't worry.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:19.260
If you wear that, you can suppress your power,

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.380
and you also won't be a target.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.830
If you train here for a bit,

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:26.470
you'll be able to control it perfectly.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:33.070
You... can say that because you're able to control it.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.960
But I...

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.660
I can't!

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.430
I'm human, just like you.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.580
I make mistakes,

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:46.970
but I don't ever give up.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:50.180
So make me a promise.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:52.740
Promise me not to abuse your power.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.980
I...

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.250
Just stay here.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:02.010
This is your home.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:04.590
The Fantasium Garden is now closed.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.510
Please come again.

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.130
Man, I'm tired.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.550
What to eat today...

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.570
We have yakisoba today!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.560
Thank you for always helping.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.320
Where's Quon-sama?

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:23.080
Miu, did you use your power again?

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.910
I see.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.370
He's with her.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:33.650
Look. This is the cafeteria.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.200
They're all your friends.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.860
Yuuma-kun!

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.470
Have you recovered already?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.830
Just take your time, and learn to get along with them.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.080
What's up?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.840
Did Ku and Tsukki have dinner?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.600
Shirogasaki Japanese Dance School

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.400
Thank you. Sorry.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:08.690
Kiri.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.900
Oh, never mind.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.240
What a beautiful voice.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:48.480
You have a magical voice that makes everyone happy.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:06.080
I believe your granddaughter has lost her voice due to mental trauma.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:10.480
Don't worry. You'll be able to talk again,

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.470
and even sing that song.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.400
It's definitely a great piece.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.640
Larva signal detected near Shinjuku-ku.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.320
It's not in the database.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.910
It's a new individual.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.400
Signal level: blue.

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:50.990
Here you go.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:54.720
It might not look appetizing, but it tastes good.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.530
The vegetables were grown in the greenhouse here.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:01.470
It's very important to eat seasonal vegetables,
so that you get plenty of...

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.020
Here we go again.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.920
Hey, you have food on your face.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:13.980
Signal level has risen to yellow.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:19.950
Naming the target BF509 due to the rising levels.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.370
Yes, we believe it's the girl.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.240
Okay. Thank you.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.020
Quon-sama is on his way.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.380
Taka-bo, when it gets bad, save him.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.880
He's on his own.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.010
Larva signal continues increase.

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:40.970
WTOC, stand by.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.920
Roger.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.970
WTOC standby level raised from 4 to 3.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.190
Begin loading units Alpha through Epsilon.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.390
Larva signal rising further.

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.880
It's only a matter of time until it breaks surveillance level.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.360
Signal lost.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.110
Cannot find its location.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:49.150
Location not confirmed.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.130
WTOC, cancel standby status.

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:01.050
Use caution when entering intersection

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:13.140
Thanks for working so late.

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:16.560
I'm introducing a new friend into your garden.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.070
What is it?

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.760
Oh, it's a persimmon.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:23.920
When I sneaked into the warehouse back home,

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:27.080
I found the seed in my great-grandfather's belongings.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.460
I never thought it'd actually sprout.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.450
Oh, the persimmon tree that was in your garden.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.080
I remember climbing it with you.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.850
No, you made me climb it!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:43.730
You always brought up my great-grandfather
and made me do the impossible!

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:47.230
How's the boy from last night?

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.960
Holding up.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:50.720
What about you?

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:58.170
I want to protect her too.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.650
Kiri.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:19.780
Aren't you tired of taking care of me all the time?

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:23.690
Why don't you go outside to play now and then?

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.930
Don't mind me. Go out and play.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.930
I want to be alone sometimes too.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.690
Front of Fantasium Garden

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:55.730
Flan, you're back?

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:13.780
Here, have some tea.

00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:17.170
Kiri-san, make yourself at home.

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:18.150
I know!

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:20.650
I'll give you a tour.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:26.900
Due to the owner's policy,
most employees are youngsters like us.

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:28.310
Let's go.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.160
Seeing is believing.

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:35.290
Enjoy.

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:39.160
Hardening of the skin...

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:41.430
It's a new type.

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:47.200
This is your home.

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:57.180
Hey!

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:58.540
Wait up!

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:01.070
Well, hurry up, or we won't make it in time!

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:01.810
Okay!

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:10.200
Each of the five areas has a virtual attraction,

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:13.100
and there's a shopping mall on the second floor.

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:16.370
They have lots of Cabbagey's goods—

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:17.600
Hey, we'll go there later!

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:31.530
Towa...

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:50.610
Thank you.

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:53.110
It's definitely a great piece.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.200
I'm Quon.

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.170
You?

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:00.840
Her name is Kiri-chan.

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:02.240
Jougasaki Kiri-chan.

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.540
Kiri-chan, huh?

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.750
What a great name.

00:24:24.850 --> 00:24:27.730
National Hospital Medical Center

00:24:34.110 --> 00:24:35.780
Kiri...

00:24:37.700 --> 00:24:40.370
Don't worry.

00:24:41.350 --> 00:24:46.340
You'll be able to talk again,

00:24:46.340 --> 00:24:48.210
and even sing that song.

00:25:12.920 --> 00:25:17.400
I wish... you'd never been born!

00:25:44.700 --> 00:25:46.600
Grandma...

00:25:48.210 --> 00:25:50.590
Kiri, you have the voice of an angel!

00:25:56.760 --> 00:26:03.570
The words... that I sing...

00:26:04.970 --> 00:26:11.370
will save my loved ones.

00:26:12.580 --> 00:26:18.090
The words that I sing...

00:26:19.560 --> 00:26:21.970
Oh, no. What should I do?

00:26:21.970 --> 00:26:22.970
How is she?

00:26:22.970 --> 00:26:24.290
She's in cardiac arrest.

00:26:24.290 --> 00:26:25.990
Contact the ICU.

00:26:29.550 --> 00:26:37.180
I will warm up the world so that...

00:26:37.930 --> 00:26:40.610
I'll always...

00:26:43.700 --> 00:26:45.020
Grandma?

00:26:45.740 --> 00:26:46.940
I knew it.

00:26:46.940 --> 00:26:49.640
Your voice is magical.

00:26:50.250 --> 00:26:51.420
Grandma!

00:26:52.660 --> 00:26:54.410
Thank God!

00:26:56.930 --> 00:26:58.830
Thank you, Kiri.

00:26:59.920 --> 00:27:01.380
Jougasaki-san!

00:27:01.380 --> 00:27:02.330
Eh?

00:27:02.350 --> 00:27:03.390
My...

00:27:04.010 --> 00:27:05.390
New larva signal detected.

00:27:05.390 --> 00:27:08.620
It's BF509, the one we lost last night.

00:27:08.620 --> 00:27:10.050
Another signal.

00:27:10.050 --> 00:27:13.730
It's BF503, the one Insania seized.

00:27:13.730 --> 00:27:15.650
Send out the WTOC.

00:27:15.650 --> 00:27:16.260
Roger.

00:27:38.340 --> 00:27:40.300
B-Seeker, loading complete.

00:27:40.300 --> 00:27:42.040
Permission to launch granted.

00:27:46.970 --> 00:27:49.820
I thought he'd calmed down.

00:27:49.820 --> 00:27:54.580
No one could understand how deep his wounds were.

00:27:57.220 --> 00:27:59.320
Yuuma-kun isn't safe right now.

00:27:59.320 --> 00:28:01.820
We have to find him quickly!

00:28:14.530 --> 00:28:18.580
Locking onto BF509 in 530 seconds.

00:28:18.580 --> 00:28:21.340
BF503 is heading south toward Shibuya.

00:28:21.340 --> 00:28:24.470
Team WTOC has passed route 7.

00:28:24.470 --> 00:28:25.960
Getting ready to surface.

00:28:25.960 --> 00:28:28.170
We have two targets.

00:28:28.170 --> 00:28:31.070
We'll split into two.

00:28:31.070 --> 00:28:34.140
Beta and gamma, go after BF503.

00:28:34.140 --> 00:28:37.760
Delta, Epsilon, and I will take BF509.

00:28:38.570 --> 00:28:40.650
All hands, equip with Selten sword.

00:28:40.650 --> 00:28:43.610
Beta and Gamma, change into heavy shields.

00:28:43.610 --> 00:28:44.160
Roger.

00:28:44.160 --> 00:28:46.240
Entering operational range.

00:28:46.240 --> 00:28:47.490
All hands ready for deployment.

00:28:48.330 --> 00:28:49.330
Connection complete.

00:28:49.330 --> 00:28:51.570
Condition all green.

00:28:51.570 --> 00:28:54.520
Alpha through Epsilon, eject from B-Seeker.

00:28:54.520 --> 00:28:56.530
Arriving at normal roads in two minutes.

00:28:58.660 --> 00:29:01.960
Order is necessary for preserving world peace.

00:29:01.960 --> 00:29:04.740
If someone breaks that order...

00:29:04.740 --> 00:29:06.950
then they are evil.

00:29:31.160 --> 00:29:32.360
Two signals.

00:29:32.360 --> 00:29:34.490
Yuuma-kun and Kiri-chan?

00:29:34.490 --> 00:29:36.000
I think so.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:36.750
What are they up to?

00:29:36.750 --> 00:29:39.540
They're sealing off all the roads.

00:29:39.540 --> 00:29:41.840
Are they using those cyborgs too?

00:29:41.840 --> 00:29:43.500
Yes, they're on the move as well.

00:29:43.500 --> 00:29:45.830
Are they taking both of them at once?

00:29:45.830 --> 00:29:47.120
What?

00:29:47.120 --> 00:29:48.980
We can't save them both at the same time!

00:29:52.460 --> 00:29:53.120
Quon-sama?

00:29:54.270 --> 00:29:56.480
Don't try to be a hero.

00:29:57.370 --> 00:29:59.380
You can't save them both.

00:29:59.380 --> 00:30:01.390
Which one are you going to save?

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:02.480
Well, hero?

00:30:06.900 --> 00:30:08.480
Both.

00:30:08.480 --> 00:30:10.860
I want to save them all.

00:30:10.870 --> 00:30:13.200
And that won't change in a thousand years.

00:30:25.360 --> 00:30:27.340
BF503 found.

00:30:27.340 --> 00:30:28.090
Following.

00:30:28.090 --> 00:30:32.220
A 500m perimeter around Shinjuku West Exit has been sealed.

00:30:32.220 --> 00:30:34.600
All units at designated locations.

00:30:38.790 --> 00:30:41.230
My voice...

00:31:31.590 --> 00:31:32.940
Quon used his power.

00:31:33.740 --> 00:31:35.450
Which one is he going to?

00:32:23.780 --> 00:32:25.130
She's still nearby.

00:32:25.130 --> 00:32:26.220
Begin search.

00:32:26.220 --> 00:32:26.910
Roger.

00:32:29.690 --> 00:32:30.090
No!

00:32:38.390 --> 00:32:41.320
Stay back!

00:32:51.480 --> 00:32:53.810
Man, give me a break.

00:32:53.810 --> 00:32:57.800
If I hadn't been close to you,
I would've been hurt.

00:32:57.800 --> 00:33:00.070
Yuri-san, what was that?

00:33:00.070 --> 00:33:01.820
Your voice...

00:33:03.280 --> 00:33:05.030
It was your power.

00:33:05.030 --> 00:33:06.070
I'll explain later.

00:33:10.090 --> 00:33:12.730
Now, hold on tight.

00:33:21.720 --> 00:33:22.680
Identified Insania.

00:33:22.680 --> 00:33:24.310
Proceeding to process two.

00:33:25.530 --> 00:33:26.820
How are they?

00:33:26.820 --> 00:33:27.600
Checking now.

00:33:31.580 --> 00:33:32.840
Yuri.

00:33:33.020 --> 00:33:34.260
Yuri.

00:33:34.260 --> 00:33:35.410
Can you hear me?

00:33:35.410 --> 00:33:35.950
Yuri.

00:33:35.950 --> 00:33:37.440
Tei?

00:33:37.440 --> 00:33:39.070
I'm in contact with Kiri-chan.

00:33:39.070 --> 00:33:41.120
Can you get Quon to come?

00:33:46.620 --> 00:33:48.700
They're inside this building.

00:33:51.880 --> 00:33:55.260
Switching from larva detection mode to thermal mode.

00:34:00.220 --> 00:34:02.770
I see. They're a fun bunch.

00:34:03.480 --> 00:34:05.090
Switch to normal vision.

00:34:05.090 --> 00:34:07.020
We'll find them with our eyes.

00:34:07.020 --> 00:34:07.520
Roger.

00:34:25.190 --> 00:34:26.330
Honestly.

00:34:26.330 --> 00:34:28.060
Hurry up, Quon.

00:34:28.060 --> 00:34:29.640
What are you people?

00:34:30.810 --> 00:34:32.360
We're Attracters.

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:36.240
According to Kannazuki, we've awakened.

00:34:36.240 --> 00:34:38.650
We can change our feelings into power.

00:34:39.510 --> 00:34:41.380
Change feelings into power?

00:34:42.610 --> 00:34:43.970
It's cold.

00:34:43.970 --> 00:34:45.390
Why do I feel so cold?

00:34:46.340 --> 00:34:48.530
Yes, and you're one of us.

00:34:48.530 --> 00:34:51.280
What? I am?

00:34:55.930 --> 00:34:56.440
Stop!

00:34:57.280 --> 00:34:59.000
Please don't kill me!

00:35:01.130 --> 00:35:02.250
Are they fighting each other?

00:35:06.300 --> 00:35:07.330
Yuuma-kun.

00:35:07.330 --> 00:35:08.250
Calm down.

00:35:09.420 --> 00:35:10.250
Look at me!

00:35:11.870 --> 00:35:13.010
Look.

00:35:13.010 --> 00:35:15.450
I'm also incomplete.

00:35:16.170 --> 00:35:18.150
But still...

00:35:18.150 --> 00:35:21.510
I want to use my power to save everyone.

00:35:23.510 --> 00:35:27.270
I'm sure your power will be helpful too.

00:35:30.810 --> 00:35:32.480
Which one won?

00:35:32.480 --> 00:35:33.510
Insania?

00:35:49.790 --> 00:35:50.540
Quon-sama!

00:35:51.170 --> 00:35:54.350
Please, don't overwork yourself anymore.

00:35:55.530 --> 00:35:57.630
Damn it.

00:35:57.630 --> 00:36:01.070
Quon, you fucking idiot!

00:36:17.290 --> 00:36:19.070
Hurry it up, you shithead!

00:36:32.450 --> 00:36:35.580
They... teleported?

00:36:44.050 --> 00:36:45.080
Hey.

00:36:45.710 --> 00:36:51.740
If I happen to die with some horrible expression on my face,

00:36:51.740 --> 00:36:55.100
would you close my eyes?

00:36:55.100 --> 00:36:56.680
Come on.

00:36:56.690 --> 00:36:59.110
I can't die looking ugly!

00:36:59.950 --> 00:37:03.110
I don't think I'll have that kind of time.

00:37:05.550 --> 00:37:07.040
Of course...

00:37:40.260 --> 00:37:40.940
You lost them?

00:37:41.640 --> 00:37:43.160
What do you mean?

00:37:51.660 --> 00:37:52.830
They're here!

00:37:52.830 --> 00:37:54.240
I see.

00:37:54.240 --> 00:37:55.590
So that's how it is.

00:38:00.290 --> 00:38:01.730
Taka-bo!

00:38:02.940 --> 00:38:03.860
Are you okay?

00:38:03.860 --> 00:38:04.810
No.

00:38:04.810 --> 00:38:06.130
I'm at my limit.

00:38:06.130 --> 00:38:08.540
That's for skipping training!

00:38:08.540 --> 00:38:09.140
Shut up.

00:38:13.160 --> 00:38:15.480
Kiri-chan, hurry up.

00:38:15.480 --> 00:38:16.460
Take this chance and escape.

00:38:16.460 --> 00:38:18.270
Okay!

00:38:18.690 --> 00:38:21.000
Now, come on.

00:38:21.000 --> 00:38:21.600
But...

00:38:21.600 --> 00:38:22.350
Hurry!

00:38:22.360 --> 00:38:23.570
Coming!

00:38:53.390 --> 00:38:54.000
Where is he?

00:39:06.530 --> 00:39:08.280
Delta, are you still functioning?

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:10.950
Yes, just barely.

00:39:11.700 --> 00:39:14.450
He was a tough opponent,
just as the data said.

00:39:16.200 --> 00:39:18.700
However, that'll end today.

00:39:19.880 --> 00:39:20.870
Get away!

00:39:34.640 --> 00:39:36.430
Alert. Intruder Alert.

00:39:36.440 --> 00:39:37.590
What's going on?

00:39:37.590 --> 00:39:41.010
The security system at the factory has activated, apparently.

00:39:41.010 --> 00:39:42.820
What's the strategy team doing?

00:39:42.820 --> 00:39:44.850
Looking into the cause.

00:39:44.860 --> 00:39:48.320
Local police and firemen are heading toward the scene.

00:39:50.570 --> 00:39:54.330
We're not ready to deal with the Japanese government yet.

00:39:54.330 --> 00:39:56.830
Retreat.

00:39:56.830 --> 00:39:59.160
Successfully hacked the factory's security system.

00:40:00.840 --> 00:40:01.790
We did it!

00:40:10.380 --> 00:40:12.430
Ow, that hurts.

00:40:12.430 --> 00:40:14.370
Be more gentle!

00:40:14.370 --> 00:40:15.800
Just be quiet!

00:40:34.830 --> 00:40:37.190
A-Are you all right?

00:40:37.190 --> 00:40:37.990
Yeah.

00:40:37.990 --> 00:40:39.260
I'm fine.

00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:44.250
Shut up! You can't do anything by yourself.

00:40:44.250 --> 00:40:44.880
That's enough!

00:40:45.970 --> 00:40:48.040
You're exactly right.

00:40:48.040 --> 00:40:51.380
I can't save everyone by myself.

00:40:51.380 --> 00:40:53.720
But you came.

00:40:56.370 --> 00:40:58.850
Thank you, Takao.

00:40:58.850 --> 00:41:00.560
And you too, Yuuma-kun.

00:41:03.060 --> 00:41:04.430
I'm sorry.

00:41:04.430 --> 00:41:06.070
I broke our promise.

00:41:06.900 --> 00:41:11.550
In return, you learned how to use your power justly.

00:41:11.550 --> 00:41:12.590
Isn't that right?

00:41:12.590 --> 00:41:13.820
But...

00:41:13.820 --> 00:41:15.540
I need to practice more.

00:41:15.540 --> 00:41:17.700
Then we can practice together.

00:41:17.700 --> 00:41:18.530
Yeah!

00:41:20.220 --> 00:41:21.910
Hey guys!

00:41:21.910 --> 00:41:23.660
Good work!

00:41:27.800 --> 00:41:29.410
What should I do?

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.670
You're also one of us.

00:41:34.490 --> 00:41:38.450
I want to save everyone, no matter what.

00:41:38.450 --> 00:41:41.350
Those who fear their powers...

00:41:41.350 --> 00:41:45.510
Others like you and Yuuma-kun
who don't know what to do...

00:41:45.520 --> 00:41:46.310
Everyone.

00:41:46.310 --> 00:41:50.170
And they're all helping me do that.

00:41:50.170 --> 00:41:52.690
So I'd like you to help me as well.

00:42:08.570 --> 00:42:13.620
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:42:13.620 --> 00:42:21.840
A scream of my burning soul that seems to burst out of my chest

00:42:13.620 --> 00:42:21.630
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:42:21.840 --> 00:42:28.420
Burst on the fire

00:42:42.140 --> 00:42:47.270
I was struck by thunderstorm, suddenly awakening my instinct

00:42:42.140 --> 00:42:47.270
raiu ni utare totsuzen mezameta honnou

00:42:47.270 --> 00:42:51.800
It burns on, pushing aside my sensibility

00:42:47.270 --> 00:42:51.800
risei wo oshinokete moetagiru no sa

00:42:51.800 --> 00:42:56.880
The truth is written on the walls of memory

00:42:51.800 --> 00:42:56.880
kioku no kabe ni kakikomareta shinjitsu wa

00:42:56.880 --> 00:43:01.230
No one can violate it

00:42:56.880 --> 00:43:01.080
dare ni mo okasenai

00:43:01.230 --> 00:43:10.630
We have no questions; we just want to break the structure of this world with our hands

00:43:01.340 --> 00:43:10.620
gimon nante nai kono sekai no shikumi wo buchikowashichimae so no te de

00:43:10.630 --> 00:43:20.840
Clear up the fate that befalls me, and then run to the future! Get on!

00:43:10.640 --> 00:43:20.840
furikakaru sadame kirihiraki ima mirai e kakenukero! Get on!

