Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:46:58.760 --> 00:47:02.040
Because I heard your heart moaning in pain.

00:47:02.040 --> 00:47:05.770
Order can only be built on top of sacrifices.

00:47:05.770 --> 00:47:08.250
The flower doesn't go well with murder.

00:47:08.250 --> 00:47:10.920
